ortDescription</a:Key><a:Value>Denial of Service happens when the process or a datastore is not able to service incoming requests or perform up to spec.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatDescription</a:Key><a:Value>An external agent interrupts data flowing across a trust boundary in either direction.</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>InteractionString</a:Key><a:Value>Admin request (Elevation of Privilege)</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Priority</a:Key><a:Value>High</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring></b:Properties><b:SourceGuid>f3cc7ac5-527a-44f8-8885-7fd45674fbc3</b:SourceGuid><b:State>AutoGenerated</b:State><b:StateInformation i:nil="true"/><b:TargetGuid>f03d22d4-8155-42ca-9ea2-33ff3bdd1c68</b:TargetGuid><b:Title i:nil="true"/><b:TypeId>D4</b:TypeId><b:Upgraded>false</b:Upgraded><b:UserThreatCategory i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatDescription i:nil="true"/><b:UserThreatShortDescription i:nil="true"/><b:Wide>false</b:Wide></a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:KeyValueOfstringThreatpc_P0_PhOB><a:Key>D3f3cc7ac5-527a-44f8-8885-7fd45674fbc3de9519a3-ae68-43df-8bd6-952b9b9007c5f03d22d4-8155-42ca-9ea2-33ff3bdd1c68</a:Key><a:Value xmlns:b="http://schemas.datacontract.org/2004/07/ThreatModeling.KnowledgeBase"><b:ChangedBy i:nil="true"/><b:DrawingSurfaceGuid>89851dc0-63a9-45b3-90b7-c444e5d4f358</b:DrawingSurfaceGuid><b:FlowGuid>de9519a3-ae68-43df-8bd6-952b9b9007c5</b:FlowGuid><b:Id>160</b:Id><b:InteractionKey>f3cc7ac5-527a-44f8-8885-7fd45674fbc3:de9519a3-ae68-43df-8bd6-952b9b9007c5:f03d22d4-8155-42ca-9ea2-33ff3bdd1c68</b:InteractionKey><b:InteractionString i:nil="true"/><b:ModifiedAt>0001-01-01T00:00:00</b:ModifiedAt><b:Priority>High</b:Priority><b:Properties><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>Title</a:Key><a:Value>Potential Process Crash or Stop for Admin Portal</a:Value></a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:KeyValueOfstringstring><a:Key>UserThreatCategory</a